ScintillaQuick vendored Scintilla fork
====================================

This directory contains Scintilla source and interface files with maintained
ScintillaQuick patches. It omits upstream platform implementations, lexers,
documentation, tests, and build scripts. LOCAL_CHANGES.md records the local
delta and the additional headers retained from an older upstream release.

Upstream project: https://www.scintilla.org/
Upstream VCS:     https://sourceforge.net/p/scintilla/code/ (Mercurial)
Upstream license: ./LICENSE (upstream License.txt, unchanged)
Local capture interface license: ../../LICENSE (BSD 2-Clause)

