Updating the fork
-----------------

1. Compare against these archives and the LOCAL_CHANGES.md ledger before
   replacing source files. Preserve or deliberately retire each local hook.
2. Record the new upstream archive/revision, checksum, import date, and
   importer here. Update the ledger in the same change as any local patch.
3. Run the full test suite (ctest) on all supported platforms, including the
   native Windows visual regression gate for capture or rendering changes.
4. Run scintillaquick_dispatch_table_test and classify newly imported SCI_*
   messages. Check the installed public-header list when interfaces change.
